  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūmalīīja kūgabīla banhū wingīji wabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya kwīdima na kwīīsuga pyī ī sī, a Baisilaeli a bose bakikuminga kū nzengo gwa Shilo, būlyīmīlīcha kwenūko ī liheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike baalīho banhū ba mu ng'anda mpungatī ja Baisilaeli, abo baalī bataalī ū kwanukūla ū wingīji wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa ūbawīla a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Mukwikala mulī bagokolo gīkī kūshisha nanalī, hū ng'wingīle kwīdima ī sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bing'we wang'winha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solanhyagi banhū badatū badatū kūfuma būlī lūganda; nabatūme baje bakwīlolaga chiza ī sī, pyī ī mihayo īyo balayībone moi baje bakwīyandīkaga, gīt'ūmo būlī wingīji wa būlī lūganda lwa banhū; hūna bize hangī kūlī nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī mukwīgabanhya mapandī mpungatī. Ī Yuda yene īkwikala ū ng'wipandī lyaayo ū kū dakama, ī numba yang'wa Yosefu nayo ū ng'wipandī lyaayo ū kū sukuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūmala ū kwīyandīka ī mihayo īyo mulīībone ū mu mapandī ga sī ayo mpungatī genayo, nenhelagi aha namutūlīgīje mbale kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a Balawī yaya ū kūsola ū wingīji hamò ning'we, nguno ū nīmo gwa būgabījibo ng'wa SEEBA hū gūlī wingīji wabo. Hama a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Gaadi nū lwa ng'wa Lubeni, nī nusu ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase baamala kwanukūla ū wingīji wabo ū kū kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani. Ū Musa ū ntamami o ng'wa SEEBA akabinha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo aho beegeela kwīnga baje bakwīlolaga ī sī, ū Yoshwa ūbakomeleja alībawīla, “Jaagi ng'wīlola chiza gete ī sī, ng'wandīke pyī ī mihayo īyo mulīībone. Hūna mushoke kūlī nene kūūnū Shilo, nize namutūlīgīje mbale kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a banhū benabo bīnga, būja hose hose pyī ū mu mizengo ya sī yenīyo. Pyī ī mihayo īyo bīībonaga bīyandīka mu shitabo, bīīgabanhya mu magele mpungatī; hūna būshoka ū kū ng'hambī ī Shilo ū kūlī Yoshwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Shilo kwenūko, ū Yoshwa ūbatūlīgīja mbale kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; ūbagabanhya a Baisilaeli ī sī alī henaho, a bose būpandīka kūlenganīla na wingīji bo ng'anda jabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabagwīīla ī mbale a banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini kūlenganīla na ndūgū jabo, yūbatūūla ha gatī ya sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda na lwa ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lwabo ū kū sukuma lwandīja kū mongo gwa Yolodani, lūūbītīla kū ntulumenho gwa Yeliko, lūūlola ng'weli kū sī ya magūlya; lūūkanyamuka hangī kwiza kūshika ng'witogolo lya Beti-aveni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kwenūko lūūtīna lūjile kū ntulumenho gwa sī ya Luzu (nūūlū Beeteli), hūna lwika lūlolile Atalooti-ada kū dakama ya ngūlya gwa Beti-holoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kū ngūlya ūyo gwilolile na Beti-holoni ī lipandī lya dakama, ū lūbīmbī lūūtūja lūjile dakama lūkūsīngījaga kūja ng'weli lūūkapulukīla Kiliati-baali (nūūlū Kiliati-yelimu). Ū gwenūyo gwaalī nzengo gwa banhū ba lūganda lwa Yuda. H'ū lūbīmbī lwa kū ng'weli ū lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lwa dakama lwaalī bbihī na nzengo gwa Kiliati-yelimu ū kū ng'weli yaho; ū kwīnga a henaho lūūgoloola lūjile kūshisha lūūkapulukīla kū nzwinzī ja minzī ga Nefutoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūūlūmbūlīla lwikile sīlīlī ya ngūlya gwa kwika kū ntubīlo gwa Beni-hinomu kū sukuma ya Lefaimu. Lūja nago ū ntubīlo gwa Hinomu, lūkūsīngījaga ntulumenho gwa dakama ya nzengo gwa Bayebusi; lūūkashika Eni-logeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma a henaho lūūtūja lūjile sukuma kūshisha Eni-shemeshi; lūūbītīlīja kūja Geliloti, īyo yilolile na nzīla ya Adumimu, hūna lwika kūja kwiwe lya ng'wa Bohani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lubeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūūlūmbūlīla na ntulumenho gwa kūlola sukuma kūja Alaba, lūūkashikīīla ū mu Alaba yenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī ū lūbīmbī lwenūlo lūūlola sukuma kūīlīīla kū ntulumenho gwa Beti-hogila, lūūkapulukīla kwikondo lya sukuma ya Nyanza ya Munhu; dakama ya mongo gwa Yolodani, aho gwingīlīlile ū mongo gwenūyo. Ū lwenūūlū hū lwalī ū lūbīmbī lwa dakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lwa kū kīya ū lwene gwalī ū mongo gwa Yolodani. Ī jenīji h'ī mbīmbī ījo jalī jīpīndīlīgije hose hose ī sī īyo bakinhwa banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini kūbiza wingīji wabo, kūlenganīla nū mumo jalī ī ndūgū jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, kūlenganīla nī ndūgū jabo yaalī īyī, Yeliko, Beti-hogila, Emekezizi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beti-alaba, Zemalaimu, Beeteli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avimu, Pala, Ofula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kefaali, Amoni, Ofini, na Geba; mizengo ikūmi n'ībīlī, hamò na magūngūli gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibeoni, Lama, Beeloti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misipa, Kefila, Moza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pekemu, Ipeeli, Talala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zela, Haelefu, nzengo gwa Bayebusi (h'ī Yelusalemu), Gibea na Kiliati; mizengo ikūmi n'īnè, hamò na magūngūlī gayo. Ū wenūbū hū walī wingīji wa banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini kūlwa ndūgū jabo pyī ī jose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.28"
